  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/From_Magic_to_Tech/BH_FMTT_header\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/From_Magic_to_Tech/BH_FMTT_header.wep\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/From_Magic_to_Tech/BH_FMTT_header.webp\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\"><strong>从魔法到科技</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\">在这个整合包中，你将开启一场随心所欲的冒险。前往太空、建造核反应堆、利用Create模组搭建巨型农场、探索世界，或用魔法将其毁灭？只要你想，一切皆有可能。本整合包收录了适合各类玩家的模组。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\">（<strong>所有特色功能与Discord服务器信息如下</strong>）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\">加入Minecraft社区服务器！IP：184.170.200.219:25565 或 fmtt.mcserver.us</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/From_Magic_to_Tech/BH_FMTT_features.webp\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\">超过300个模组</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\">JourneyMap</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\">Create模组</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\">Waystones</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\">自定义动画主菜单</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\">Complementary光影 v5，作者：<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/EminGTR/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">EminGTR</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\">新武器</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\">新建筑</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\">新生物</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\">新Boss</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\">火箭与星球</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\">新食物与作物</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\">新生物群系</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\">进入末地的全新方式</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\">全新的末地与下界维度</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\">驯服巨龙</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\">MineColonies</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fcuUaqmDFzR\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/From_Magic_to_Tech/BH_FMTT_discord.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fcuUaqmDFzR\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入Discord服务器：&nbsp;&nbsp;https://discord.com/invite/cuUaqmDFzR</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\"><strong>截图：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/111522952/253256407-fc305cff-a8d8-4149-861c-b8122186aaac.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/111522952/257009304-f64c84b2-d7c6-4e16-bb69-9aba30b37319.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 3\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/111522952/257009322-a4e66e69-f1af-4dbb-84b3-c9688f7bdeff.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 4\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\"><strong>暮色森林</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Gabriele-333/FMTT/assets/111522952/b9c1ce84-a702-46fd-af38-44f127ba4d36\" alt=\"Screenshot 5\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\"><strong>幽暗花园</strong></span></p>",
